{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friends\u2019 Kitchen: Demo Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the kitchen s<strong>olo or online with up to 4 players</strong>\u00a0and try the pizza stage before the full feast. <strong>In this demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in <strong>Single Player</strong> mode as the <strong>Chef</strong> or the <strong>Waiter</strong>, handling all tasks solo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or team up with friends in <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong>: one player plays as Chef, and the other as Waiter (each role should be played by at least one player), coordinating to prep, cook, plate, and serve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle chaos:</strong> burning pizzas, slippery floors, colliding characters\u2014all present in the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a <strong>limited set of recipes and hazards</strong>, focused only on the pizza-themed stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you won\u2019t see until full release:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More recipes beyond pizza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional levels and layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded hazard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer / couch co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full campaign progression and rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a taste of the full game\u2019s energy, then unlock the full menu in the official release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Even the demo may cause sudden laughter and unexpected hunger. \ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf73</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3341760?t=1760082621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/ap